# Normalise everything to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# src/cli.js starts with a `#!/usr/bin/env node` shebang. If that line ends
# with CRLF, the interpreter path becomes "node\r" and `npx dlt-error-codes`
# fails with "bad interpreter" on macOS and Linux. Forcing LF prevents a
# Windows checkout from ever publishing a broken executable.
* text=auto eol=lf
